OL,12,G0306 Outlook
OL,13,     FIt can be hard to confront your
OL,14,     Fdad - especially if it's about his
OL,15,     Fsubstance abuse. Grace Harper
OL,16,     FBrighouse used her camera and the
OL,17,     Fexcuse of a dying dog to really
OL,18,     Funderstand him.
